{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"aziontech.azion","latestVersion":"4.24.0-dev.20","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Azion CLI is used for managing Azion services via command-line","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/aziontech/azion/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Azion CLI is used for managing Azion services via command-line","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/aziontech/azion/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Azion CLI is an open source command-line interface (CLI) that lets you interact with Azion Edge Platform using a terminal. You can use Azion CLI to:\n* Initialize, build, and deploy edge applications.\n* Create Jamstack applications.\n* Manage the edge applications on the platform.\n* Have a local development server running.\n* Link an existing project to an Azion edge application.\n\nAzion disposes of a set of options to interact with the Azion products, such as:\n* Azion Terraform Provider\n* Azion API\n* Azion SDK for Go\n\nThe Azion CLI is built in Go and interacts with Azion products through the Azion Go SDK.","moniker":"azioncli","name":"Azion CLI","packageUrl":"https://www.azion.com/en/documentation/products/azion-cli/overview/","publisher":"Azion Technologies","publisherUrl":"https://www.azion.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/aziontech/azion/releases/tag/4.24.0-dev.20","tags":["cli","go","golang","linearb-test","swe-prod","team-devtools"]}},"longDescription":"Azion CLI is an open source command-line interface (CLI) that lets you interact with Azion Edge Platform using a terminal. You can use Azion CLI to:\n* Initialize, build, and deploy edge applications.\n* Create Jamstack applications.\n* Manage the edge applications on the platform.\n* Have a local development server running.\n* Link an existing project to an Azion edge application.\n\nAzion disposes of a set of options to interact with the Azion products,